Z||000028||California Kid||07-13-2001||05:10 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Formula88:<BR><B>Very nice!  Love the wheels, too.  What are they?   Mental note: In the dictionary under [b]<I><FONT COLOR="yellow"><FONT SIZE="3">YELLOW!</FONT></FONT></I></B> see: 98 Viper Yellow.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>[This message has been edited by Formula88 (edited 07-13-2001).][/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks again to everyone for your commments!!<BR>Wheels are OZ Monte Carlo Racing with Carbon Centers, 16X7.5 (PN 23032202), Frt. Tires BFG Rad. T/A 215X50X16, Rr. are T/A 245X50X16. Car has been lowered 1.5 inches front and rear (no tires clearance issues), Koni Racing Suspension all around.<BR>Tom<BR>||||reg||1
